      | required            | gate_report    | verify_report  | false |                                                           | [{"gate": 4, "name": "drift", "pass": false}]                    |                                        |          |          |                                                 | []                                                                                                |
      | required            | domain_report  | verify_report  | false |                                                           |                                                                  | [{"gates": []}]                        |          |          |                                                 | []                                                                                                |
      | minimum             | warning_count  | verify_report  | true  |                                                           |                                                                  |                                        | -1       |          |                                                 | []                                                                                                |
      | required            | diff_report    | diff_report    | true  |                                                           |                                                                  |                                        |          |          |                                                 |                                                                                                   |
